    public String getValue() {
        return value;
    }

    public void setValue(String value) {
        this.value = value;
    }
}
```

#### Step 4: Use XMLInputFactory and XMLStreamReader to Deserialize Data

You can also use `XMLInputFactory` and `XMLStreamReader` to deserialize data:

```java
import javax.xml.stream.XMLInputFactory;
